   "external": "https://diff.wikimedia.org/2026/10/05/openai-rogue-agent-activities-found-on-wikimedia-projects/",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "Full disclosure: I have deals with Apple, Google, OpenAI, Adobe and a bunch of others.\n\nUnfortunately the deal is that I pay them a monthly fee in exchange for their services.",
